WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:01:06.320 --> 00:01:08.840
They are groups of soldiers,

00:01:10.760 --> 00:01:14.640
of which someone occasionally takes
command to carry out a mission.

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:16.320
This clearly isn't adequate

00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:19.440
and is not an effective way
of running an army.

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:23.720
It is also an army
that is very under-equipped,

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:28.800
or very poorly equipped
with lots of materiel that was supplied

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:33.880
during 20 years of bilateral cooperation
with numerous different countries.

00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:38.800
Its collection of materiel,
vehicles and other means of transport

00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:44.680
is motley and miscellaneous and
needs to be taken out of service

00:01:44.840 --> 00:01:47.280
because it is very difficult to maintain

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:50.960
and is often not suitable for
training the Mali army

00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:54.560
and for use in the desert
by the Mali army.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:58.200
There's a very important cultural factor
as it is very multinational.

00:02:58.360 --> 00:03:02.720
A number of European countries are
represented in some teams of trainers.

00:03:02.880 --> 00:03:07.640
Behind me is an infantry company
put together by Scandinavian countries

00:03:07.800 --> 00:03:11.040
and composed of Swedes,
Finns and Estonians.

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:13.920
There are different nationalities
in the same team.

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:18.480
The aim of all this training is
for people to learn to work together,

00:03:18.640 --> 00:03:21.960
to have common procedures
and learn basic French.

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:34.480
Perhaps it is too much.

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:41.640
Our task is to ensure medical care is
provided for the EU training mission.

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:47.760
It is better to take too much
than to not have enough.

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:52.760
That's our guideline, that we are able
to ensure the provision of medical care.

00:04:52.920 --> 00:04:58.120
We have to take a bit extra with us for
the first offensive as we don't know

00:04:58.280 --> 00:05:00.800
when we will receive
the next lot of supplies.

00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:06.280
Our soldiers are prepared for that.
It's part of the training.

00:06:06.440 --> 00:06:10.880
What is training? It doesn't
take place in the lap of luxury.

00:06:11.040 --> 00:06:15.960
Suppose these soldiers were to think

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:19.440
we lead a life of luxury in the army,
then they will be very put out

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:25.000
when they are on Tigharghar,
in the mountains,

00:06:25.160 --> 00:06:28.360
on the Adrar des Ifoghas,
and see it's very different.

00:06:28.880 --> 00:06:33.840
We are military men, we are soldiers,
we are supermen,

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:36.240
we opted for this,
we wanted to save the world.

